              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaaza aha nshuro y'amaizi, yaaginagamu omwonyo, yaagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Naatambira aga maizi; okuruga hati tigakirugwamu rufu nari okutorooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
