        {
          "text": "Yaarugayo, yainamuka, yaaza Beseeli; ku yaabaire naakigyenda, haija abatsigazi bato nibaruga omu rurembo, baamugaaniiza nibagira bati: Iwe mushaija w'oruhara 'we, inamuka! Iwe mushaija w'oruhara 'we, inamuka! ",
          "type": "text",
