        },
        {
          "text": " Yaahinduka; ku yaabareebire, yaabakyeena omu iziina rya MUKAMA; ahonaaho haija edubu ibiri z'enkazi zaaruga omu kibira, zaabataagataaguramu abatsigazi makumi ana na babiri. ",
